/docs/integrations/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/overview#transport-types","content":"Most connectors use **stdio** transport — Gent spawns a local process and communicates over stdin/stdout. A few built-in connectors (like Gent Canvas) are handled directly by the app without spawning a separate process."},"703":{"id":"/docs/integrations/overview-37","page_id":"/docs/integrations/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/overview#next-steps","content":"Set up a connector — step-by-step guide"},"704":{"id":"/docs/integrations/overview-38","page_id":"/docs/integrations/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/overview#next-steps","content":"Browse all connectors — full list by category"},"705":{"id":"/docs/integrations/overview-39","page_id":"/docs/integrations/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/overview#next-steps","content":"Claude Code integration — detailed guide for the most popular CLI"},"706":{"id":"/docs/integrations/overview-40","page_id":"/docs/integrations/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/overview#next-steps","content":"Custom connectors — add your own MCP servers"},"707":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","type":"page","content":"Skills","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Integrations"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/integrations/skills"},"708":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-0","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills","content":"Extend your AI agents with installable skills."},"709":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-1","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"How skills work"},"710":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-2","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/integrations/skills#browsing-the-marketplace","content":"Browsing the marketplace"},"711":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-3","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/integrations/skills#open-settings","content":"Open Settings"},"712":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-4","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/integrations/skills#navigate-to-skills","content":"Navigate to Skills"},"713":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-5","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/integrations/skills#browse-and-preview","content":"Browse and preview"},"714":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-6","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/integrations/skills#install","content":"Install"},"715":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-7","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/integrations/skills#using-skills-in-chat","content":"Using skills in chat"},"716":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-8","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/integrations/skills#skill-structure","content":"Skill structure"},"717":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-9","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/integrations/skills#managing-installed-skills","content":"Managing installed skills"},"718":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-10","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/integrations/skills#custom-skills","content":"Custom skills"},"719":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-11","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills","content":"Skills are reusable prompt templates and commands that you install into your AI coding CLIs. They add slash commands, specialized behaviors, and domain-specific knowledge to your agent chat sessions — like plugins for your AI assistant."},"720":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-12","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills","content":"For example, a \"code review\" skill might add a `/review` command that instructs the agent to follow a specific review checklist. A \"testing\" skill might add `/test-spec` that generates tests from a specification file. Skills encode best practices into repeatable, shareable commands."},"721":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-13","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"When you install a skill, Gent places it in the appropriate directory for each CLI:"},"722":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-14","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"CLI"},"723":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-15","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"Skill directory"},"724":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-16","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"Claude Code"},"725":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-17","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"`.claude/skills/`"},"726":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-18","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"Codex"},"727":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-19","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"`.codex/skills/`"},"728":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-20","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"Copilot"},"729":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-21","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"`.copilot/skills/`"},"730":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-22","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"Shared"},"731":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-23","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"`.mate/skills/`"},"732":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-24","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"Skills installed through Gent are symlinked across CLI directories, so a single skill works with all your agents without duplication. Install it once, use it everywhere."},"733":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-25","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#how-skills-work","content":"Each skill is a markdown file that contains the prompt template and metadata the CLI uses to register it as a slash command."},"734":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-26","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#open-settings","content":"Go to the **Settings** tab in Gent."},"735":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-27","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#navigate-to-skills","content":"Find the **Skills** section. This shows the marketplace — a browsable list of available skills organized by category."},"736":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-28","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#browse-and-preview","content":"Each skill shows its name, description, and what slash commands it adds. You can preview the full prompt template before installing."},"737":{"id":"/docs/integrations/skills-29","page_id":"/docs/integrations/skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/integrations/skills#install","content":"Tap **Install** on any skill. Ge