s (send + receive)"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/remote/overview-53","page_id":"/docs/remote/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/overview#platform-capabilities","content":"Create sessions"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/remote/overview-54","page_id":"/docs/remote/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/overview#platform-capabilities","content":"Yes (local)"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/remote/overview-55","page_id":"/docs/remote/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/overview#platform-capabilities","content":"Yes (created on paired desktop)"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Remote Troubleshooting","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Remote"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","content":"Common remote connection issues and how to fix them."},"1255":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#devices-not-discovering-each-other","content":"Devices not discovering each other"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#connection-drops","content":"Connection drops"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#terminal-lag","content":"Terminal lag"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#port-conflicts","content":"Port conflicts"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#web-preview-not-loading","content":"Web preview not loading"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#agent-chat-not-connecting-remotely","content":"Agent chat not connecting remotely"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#still-stuck","content":"Still stuck?"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","content":"Most remote connection problems come down to network configuration. Here are the common issues and their fixes."},"1263":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#devices-not-discovering-each-other","content":"**Symptom**: You open Gent on both devices, but they do not appear in each other's sidebar."},"1264":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#devices-not-discovering-each-other","content":"**Fixes**:"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#devices-not-discovering-each-other","content":"**Same network**: Confirm both devices are on the exact same Wi-Fi network. Some routers have separate 2.4GHz and 5GHz networks — make sure both devices are on the same one."},"1266":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#devices-not-discovering-each-other","content":"**Multicast blocking**: Gent uses multicast UDP for discovery. Some enterprise networks, guest networks, and mesh routers block multicast traffic. Try a different network or check your router's settings."},"1267":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#devices-not-discovering-each-other","content":"**macOS local network permission**: On macOS, go to **System Settings > Privacy & Security > Local Network** and make sure Gent is allowed."},"1268":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#devices-not-discovering-each-other","content":"**Firewall**: Check that no firewall is blocking:"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#devices-not-discovering-each-other","content":"TCP port **53317** (or your configured port)"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#devices-not-discovering-each-other","content":"Multicast UDP traffic"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#devices-not-discovering-each-other","content":"**Restart both apps**: Close and reopen Gent on both devices. This triggers a fresh multicast scan."},"1272":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#connection-drops","content":"**Symptom**: Devices pair successfully but the connection drops intermittently."},"1273":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#connection-drops","content":"**Fixes**:"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#connection-drops","content":"**Wi-Fi stability**: Check signal strength on both devices. Weak Wi-Fi causes intermittent TCP disconnections."},"1275":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#connection-drops","content":"**Sleep/standby**: When a device sleeps, the network connection drops. Gent reconnects automatically when the device wakes, but there may be a brief delay."},"1276":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#connection-drops","content":"**Network switching**: If your phone switches between Wi-Fi and cellular, the connection drops. Make sure your phone stays on Wi-Fi."},"1277":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#connection-drops","content":"Gent uses exponential backoff for reconnection attempts. If the connection drops, it will try to reconnect automatically — starting at 10 seconds and backing off to 80 seconds between attempts."},"1278":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#terminal-lag","content":"**Symptom**: Typing in a remote terminal feels slow or laggy."},"1279":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#terminal-lag","content":"**Fixes**:"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#terminal-lag","content":"**Network latency**: Remote terminals depend on network round-trip time. On a typical home Wi-Fi network, latency should be under 10ms. If it feels slow, check your network quality."},"1281":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#terminal-lag","content":"**High output programs**: Programs that produce large amounts of output (e.g., `cat` on a huge file, `find /` without filters) can cause temporary lag as the data streams over the network."},"1282":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#terminal-lag","content":"**Try restarting the session**: Close the terminal tab and open a new one. Occasionally a session can get into a degraded state."},"1283":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#port-conflicts","content":"**Symptom**: Gent fails to start or pair, with errors about port 53317."},"1284":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#port-conflicts","content":"**Fix**: Another application is using port 53317. You can change Gent's port in **Settings**. Make sure both devices use the same port."},"1285":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#web-preview-not-loading","content":"**Symptom**: Web preview tab shows a blank page or connection error."},"1286":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#web-preview-not-loading","content":"**Fixes**:"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#web-preview-not-loading","content":"**Server running**: Make sure your dev server is actually running on the specified port on the desktop"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#web-preview-not-loading","content":"**Localhost binding**: Some dev servers bind to `127.0.0.1` only. Gent's reverse proxy handles this, but check that the server is running"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#web-preview-not-loading","content":"**Port number**: Double-check you entered the correct port number in the web preview tab"},"1290":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#agent-chat-not-connecting-remotely","content":"**Symptom**: You can see agent chat tabs from a remote device but cannot send messages or see updates."},"1291":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#agent-chat-not-connecting-remotely","content":"**Fixes**:"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#agent-chat-not-connecting-remotely","content":"**CLI installed on desktop**: The AI CLI (Claude Code, Codex, etc.) must be installed on the desktop, not the remote device"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#agent-chat-not-connecting-remotely","content":"**Process running**: Check that the agent chat process is still running on the desktop — it may have exited due to an error"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting#agent-chat-not-connecting-remotely","content":"**Reconnect**: Switch away from the remote device in the sidebar and switch back to force a reconnection"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/remote/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"t